ng", "id": "924884167264586", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620817_924884170597919_3406350104019439407_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fkm1HVuSeKIQ7kNvwH1nI27&_nc_oc=AdoLAIK7KNnKTm88340qiU3j-wnNzeolN5ewVlgd8aQCL7RilV0ExLTmZLg1xPDvs9U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIFmvuLb9zA4b217gLnwtgPV_Vdyp2KcVVR0P0egPERog&oe=6AA16C0B"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "998232089451140", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623384_998232092784473_2328103235580800332_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QDCXoUvT9JwQ7kNvwE-ea0Z&_nc_oc=AdrCilfA05_JTAgQlLLJaq2zEUcA682D6_0NzRIwF1EGQWk4oXwwqwbVYQHgPXQ7IRk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLeqfbWt4em5ah3l2Pfce3Jo-W06fcAXvlMG44AQJCzcg&oe=6AA149B6"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1982148652394545", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654867655_1982148655727878_6443745899874587342_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n-gZsG0bOfcQ7kNvwH0BkVF&_nc_oc=Ado6NhlyolXQ97NeXhGb6o_vwPxWQiCMOHQbCIqXayHw9LCspPXpoe9BZhehzn6ZlX0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKaLvtnmfUMqRF6PdjeUaIby-F-xFRZdSXVVCWEP-NMtg&oe=6AA1563A"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1483737686240246", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623295_1483737689573579_7024275750668855584_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BGViX0GShuwQ7kNvwGkS2g4&_nc_oc=AdqLshx4d7104yztdLqWYGrm567FXyz3o2JrSIkzwYqHv54T9I3ApYY4maaF0_8f4aE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKksDOOah-rVaFtIEPNqORCEshwKZlmWhtFd_2WyQz71g&oe=6AA17A5B"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2435216086947015", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622214_2435216090280348_3156147719830534193_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3KziFAUwLBMQ7kNvwE_VYLB&_nc_oc=Adqwm0zgcyv-nnh1IFRK5FPlPnOasjLj0yVgVh3ZiYUd6FlLVvR9cCmu8C1Tlu43_SI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKJbM0frZ8QDY8jkMJs8f6f2--I_HAFa8vzOAUXix4Pbw&oe=6AA14E2A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Paysage.png", "id": "1307100734206067", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620921_1307100737539400_265628498726652087_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ElHD4WQxWRMQ7kNvwHKZzBG&_nc_oc=AdofYtF8x9A93vcYua7N-LWhAWAXrT6NbLPL2lOhwH_Yh3WqUzLBC6Dv35OyVYL4QiA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIaPbOny-Ocfh3kW6VOhIkG44igDovGWoEChU8mYU8tWQ&oe=6AA15034"}, "display_name": "Project S", "keywords": ["RTS", "Strategy", "Tabletop", "Battle", "Robots"], "long_description": "**Classic RTS. Rebuilt for VR.**\n\nProject S is a fast-paced, explosive VR real-time strategy game inspired by the addictive spirit of classic 90s RTS games completely reimagined for Meta Quest.\n\nCommand your army from above a living tabletop battlefield. Capture factories, build robotic units, steal powerful vehicles, expand your territory, and destroy the enemy base before they destroy yours.\n{1593671992120931}\n\nUnlock and command **more than 10 different units and vehicles**, each bringing new tactical possibilities to the battlefield. Explore **2 unique planets across 8 levels**, with new environments, challenges, and more planets coming very soon.\n\nEasy to learn but challenging to master, every battle rewards fast decisions, smart positioning, aggressive expansion, and tactical control.\n\nThis isn\u2019t just an RTS viewed through a headset \u2014 **you are standing over the battlefield.** Watch your robots move, fight, capture, survive, and explode right in front of you as the warzone comes alive in VR.\n\nBuild. Capture. Expand. Attack. Conquer.\n\nProject S is created by a passionate solo developer using modern development and AI-assisted tools to help accelerate production.\n\nAnd the war is only beginning. **More planets are planned as FREE DLC**, bringing new missions and challenges. **Multiplayer is also in development**, with the goal of bringing competitive VR RTS battles to Project S.\n\nTake command. Build your army. Own the battlefield.\n{825370027270066}\n", "short_description": "**Command. Conquer. Dominate.**\n\nProject S brings the thrill of classic 90s real-time strategy into VR, turning the battlefield into an explosive tabletop warzone right in front of you.\n\nCapture factories, build your robot army, deploy powerful vehicles, expand your territory, and crush enemy forces in fast-paced strategic battles designed from the ground up for Meta Quest.\n\nEasy to pick up but challenging to master, Project S combines instant VR action with the tactical depth of classic RTS."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1072869018424975", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Project S", "keywords": ["RTS", "Strategie", "Combat", "Fight"], "long_description": "**Le RTS classique. R\u00e9invent\u00e9 pour la VR.**\n\nProject S est un jeu de strat\u00e9gie en temps r\u00e9el en VR, rapide et explosif, inspir\u00e9 par l\u2019esprit addictif des grands RTS des ann\u00e9es 90 \u2014 enti\u00e8rement repens\u00e9 pour Meta Quest.\n\nCommandez votre arm\u00e9e depuis les hauteurs d\u2019un champ de bataille miniature vivant. Capturez des usines, produisez des robots, volez de puissants v\u00e9hicules, \u00e9tendez votre territoire et d\u00e9truisez la base ennemie avant qu\u2019elle ne d\u00e9truise la v\u00f4tre.\n{1490733139737836}\n\nExplorez **2 plan\u00e8tes et 8 niveaux**, et d\u00e9bloquez **plus de 10 unit\u00e9s et v\u00e9hicules** pour d\u00e9velopper de nouvelles strat\u00e9gies.\n\nFacile \u00e0 prendre en main mais difficile \u00e0 ma\u00eetriser, chaque bataille r\u00e9compense les d\u00e9cisions rapides, le positionnement, l\u2019expansion et le contr\u00f4le tactique.\n\nCe n\u2019est pas simplement un RTS dans un casque \u2014 **vous dominez r\u00e9ellement le champ de bataille.** Regardez vos robots avancer, combattre, capturer et exploser juste devant vous tandis que la guerre prend vie en VR.\n\nConstruisez. Capturez. \u00c9tendez-vous. Attaquez. Conqu\u00e9rez.\n\nProject S est cr\u00e9\u00e9 par un d\u00e9veloppeur solo passionn\u00e9 avec l\u2019aide d\u2019outils modernes et de technologies assist\u00e9es par IA.\n\n**De nouvelles plan\u00e8tes arriveront en DLC GRATUITS** et **le multijoueur est en d\u00e9veloppement**.\n\nPrenez le commandement. Construisez votre arm\u00e9e. Dominez le champ de bataille.\n{4496065007318778}\n", "short_description": "**Commandez. Conqu\u00e9rez. Dominez.**\n\nProject S fait rena\u00eetre toute l\u2019intensit\u00e9 des grands jeux de strat\u00e9gie en temps r\u00e9el des ann\u00e9es 90 en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle, transformant le champ de bataille en une zone de guerre miniature explosive, directement sous vos yeux.\n\nCapturez des usines, construisez votre arm\u00e9e de robots, d\u00e9ployez de puissants v\u00e9hicules, \u00e9tendez votre territoire et \u00e9crasez les forces ennemies dans des batailles strat\u00e9giques rapides et explosives, enti\u00e8rement pens\u00e9es pour Meta Quest."}]}, "developer_name": "Stephane Quillet", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://projectsvr.net/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XFX", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://projectsvr.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_lan